      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">01-02-2023: 1. Invitation of 3 female trainers as role models for female trainees. Two from the Netherlands, one from Cuba.
2. Offering 2 females out of 4 selected to create a choreography. Both females focused on gender issuess: internet harrasement (sexting) and the position of female artist in society.
3. One female won a prize with her choreography to commission a new work on a gender theme by the Institute Francais Benin
4, Promoting female choreographies to be performed at different (inter)national festivals</narrative>
