       <narrative xml:lang="EN">06-02-2023: During the reflection week, with alumni leaders from different countries we elaborated on gender equality as an important attitude in training and also to create work with attention for women&apos;s issues, To encourage females to continue as artists, to make their own work etc. All company leaders have this attitude as a guiding principle, without being written out in an official regulation. In Compagnie Walo a gender equality approach has been established for many years. The artistic director and  direct assistance are both females who guide and control  equality.</narrative>
